Package: stblob
Title: STblob (SpatioTemporal blob) Optimisation Algorithm for Regional Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Victor Yan Kin", "Lee", , "yan.kin.lee@sund.ku.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-5598-9632"))
Description: 
    The package provides the tools for
    optimising and evaluating the spatiotemporal blobs for regional time series.
    The main function `stblob()` implements the STblob algorithm that
    approximates the optimal trade-offs (Pareto front) between
    within-cluster spatial proximity, temporal coverage and data type diversity.
    Users will be able to select from the optimised partitions for subsequent analyses.
    The package also provides supporting functions to help users in decision making.
